 "description": "Use this when the user wants one firm's government award history and its UEI is known, e.g. from a search_awards row.\n\nReturns the firm's name and other spellings, location (city, state, country), totals for contract and grant awards, first and last award dates, top NAICS codes and agencies, and its 10 most recent awards. No contact details. Award records may be incomplete, so say so. Example: uei=\"C3KXNLTAAY98\".\n\nPrint each recent award's url and source_url as markdown links.\n\nDo not use for finding firms by name or NAICS (search_awards) or for contact details (none are available).",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "uei": {
    "description": "12-character UEI, e.g. 'C3KXNLTAAY98'.",
    "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9]{12}$",
    "title": "Uei",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "uei"
  ],
  "title": "get_companyArguments",
  "type": "object"
 },
